# Provider-billing analysis artifacts (backend/scripts/*.mts inputs+outputs).
# These are REAL production billing extracts — per-task provider ids, per-model
# volume, and our provider unit rate. Generate them locally when auditing; they
# must never be committed (backend/kie-per-task.json shipped in every release
# tarball from 2026-07-30 until this rule). check-billing-dumps.mjs enforces it.
kie-per-task.json
kie-actual.json
per-second-rates.json
observed-costs.json
a2-sheet.json
